{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Key Features</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Automation and Magic:</strong> Build and connect magical machines that channel and convert cursed energy into life, forming intricate, self-sustaining systems.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3649320/extras/3.gif?t=1746418788\" /></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Magical Terraforming:</strong> Cleanse a cursed, fog-covered island and transform it into a thriving, vibrant ecosystem using arcane technology.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3649320/extras/8.gif?t=1746418788\" /></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Living World:</strong> See real-time environmental transformation\u2014watch as dead forests bloom, creatures return, and storms shift with the rise of magic.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3649320/extras/Sequence_02.gif?t=1746418788\" /></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Resource Crafting:</strong> Gather rare materials, refine them through magical processes, and fuel your growing terraforming network.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3649320/extras/Sequence_02_1.gif?t=1746418788\" /></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Intuitive Base Building:</strong> Construct small castles with an easy, modular building system.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3649320/extras/4.gif?t=1746418788\" /></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Explore and Uncover:</strong> Discover lost blueprints, ancient technologies, and hidden lore scattered across a mysterious open world.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3649320/extras/5.gif?t=1746418788\" /></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Chill Survival:</strong> No combat. Light survival elements focused on exploration, creativity, and progress\u2014not punishment.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3649320/extras/6.gif?t=1746418788\" /></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Atmospheric Aesthetic:</strong> Early-2010s RPG visuals and mysterious vibes.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3649320/extras/7.gif?t=1746418788\" /></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3649320?t=1746418788","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3649320/c58a5134bba048058d4213e35064150cfef4f746/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1746418788","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3649320/ddbb8e6fb9728d3f4ead1c504813efe0d6be8a2c/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1746418788","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3649320/ddbb8e6fb9728d3f4ead1c504813efe0d6be8a2c/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1746418788","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Captions available","id":13},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"controller_support":"full","detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Key Features</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_